Mon Sep 21 07:11:14 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.86.1:
  * Meta (Muse subscription) login via /login meta, with automatic
    Model API key refresh, and META_API_KEY support
  * Restore the OSC 52 clipboard fallback when no display is
    available, fixing copy in containers and under WSL
  * Recognise inherited z.ai "Prompt too long" errors as context
    overflow
  * Stop inherited Cerebras models advertising unsupported strict
    tool schemas, which returned HTTP 400 when strict and
    non-strict tools were mixed
  * /bug descriptions keep line breaks from pasted diagnostics,
    and its hints no longer appear for user cancellations
- Changes from version 0.86.0:
  * Prompt cache warming keeps valuable caches alive during long
    tool runs, with cost-aware refreshes
  * Report problems with /bug using redacted diagnostics, an
    optional transcript or an exported ZIP
  * Instruction and tool changes survive resume and branch
    navigation while cached prefixes are retained
  * Offline Radius model catalogue, overlaid with the live one
    when available
  * Per-model compaction budgets for reserved and recent tokens
  * Breaking for extension authors: provider stream inputs take a
    normalized TranscriptContext, ToolCall.arguments and
    ToolResultMessage.details are restricted to JSON-compatible
    values, and user_bash now fails closed
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's CHANGELOG.md
    for the full list
- Upstream replaced the @mariozechner/clipboard optional addon with
  helpers bundled in @earendil-works/pi-tui, including a prebuilt
  linux-x11 .node that a noarch package cannot ship. It is dropped
  in %build, so xclip, xsel and wl-clipboard are the only local
  clipboard mechanism here; xsel is now recommended too, as pi's
  own error text names it
- Refresh package-lock.json (integrity filled in for the five
  @earendil-works siblings, 26 esbuild platform entries stripped)
  and the vendored node_modules archive to match: 127 to 116
  shipped modules, the @aws-crypto and fast-xml-parser sets gone,
  proxy-agent-negotiate new, license union unchanged

